id: freertos_heap_5
label: FreeRTOS Heap 5
package: freertos
description: 'A heap implementation for FreeRTOS.

  A sample implementation of pvPortMalloc() that allows the heap to be defined across multiple non-contigous blocks and combines (coalescences) adjacent memory blocks as they are freed.

  '
category: RTOS|FreeRTOS
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    reference: freertos
source:
- path: kernel/portable/MemMang/heap_5.c
provides:
- name: freertos_heap
- name: freertos_heap_5
requires:
- name: cmsis_core
- name: freertos
template_contribution:
- name: rte_components
  value: RTE_RTOS_FreeRTOS_HEAP_5
root_path: freertos
